        }
      }
    },
    "Cheese (cubed Brick, young Gouda or Mozzarella) all the way to the edges – that makes the crispy rim." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Käse (Brick, junger Gouda oder Mozzarella in Würfeln) bis ganz an den Rand – das gibt die knusprige Kante."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close the Ooni app first (or disconnect the hub there) – the hub usually accepts only one connection." : {
